ies":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"A0DYN5wxygYnX_sL3HygvA","review_id":"K7skVwqXNj3LIB-BFKjWOQ","date":"2021-08-11T04:08:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9488164782524109,"text_excerpt":"So. Freaking. Bomb. After having dinner here once, I want to come back and try every single thing on their menu. Came on a Saturday night and didn't have reservations - they were busy, but we managed to snag some seats at the bar. Not as great of a view as the balcony, but for no wait and the same amazing food, it was worth it. The gumbo didn't look like much, but the flavor was insane.. the only way I could describe it was like eating fried chicken in soup form. The shrimp and grits and pork chop dishes were also amazing, we finished every bite! Drinks were great, as was dessert! You cannot go wrong with the bread pudding, with a scoop of ice cream on top, of course. The service was also..."},{"business_id":"A0DYN5wxygYnX_sL3HygvA","review_id":"FBdYQCnw07RkIlpAUsxOWg","date":"2020-11-28T18:04:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9405129551887512,"text_excerpt":"This place is just awesome. First of all, I need Saturday brunch. They have Saturday and Sunday brunch, with some awesome menu items to choose from. So in we came, and sat at the bar (which we were so glad to get to do again!) First off, they followed all safety protocols, and do offer some outdoor seats, as well. They had sanitizer available everywhere, and tables were still distanced when we were in. Now, on to the food! We ordered some gumbo and the chicken gizzards for appetizers. Their gumbo is KILLER - I highly recommend it. They don't use a super dark or bitter roux, which I prefer. A big portion, too! The chicken gizzards probably won't be for everyone, but they were crispy and ju..."},{"business_id":"A0DYN5wxygYnX_sL3HygvA","review_id":"q82gG8fQVfKrYPKsnUu4LA","date":"2021-12-16T17:00:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371620416641235,"text_excerpt":"I have had this place on my radar for about as long as it's been open. And, much like other local places, the radar has lots of blips on it, so it isn't always at the top of the list... Until last week when I was craving chicken and dumplings and they came up as a great place to have them... so, we create an occasion! I made a reservation on Resy yesterday afternoon, and it was all about being there on time or being charged $25 per person if you cancelled. I got there 10 minutes early, they said the couple before had their bill, and they were just waiting to clear it out. No biggie. Fast forward an hour and we were finally seated (50 minutes past Resy time.) They were full of apologies, o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"A0DYN5wxygYnX_sL3HygvA","photo_id":"NyNW6hEaOaKodQ5QYWhnZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NyNW6hEaOaKodQ5QYWhnZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8925547003746033},{"business_id":"A0DYN5wxygYnX_sL3HygvA","photo_id":"F9ZrBsbedoG7aWAtPVx8BA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F9ZrBsbedoG7aWAtPVx8BA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8872970938682556},{"business